    "Id": "chassisdef_logan_x_LGX-QS2",
    "Name": "Logan-X",
    "Details": "The Logan-X, named such for some unknown reason, is an export superheavy 'Mech made by Quicsell and offloaded at a very cheap cost to the periphery states.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Easy to Pilot</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.18</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
